{
  "id": "whisper-note",
  "name": "note",
  "category": "深夜耳语",
  "description": "一段深夜的悄悄话记录",
  "trigger": {
    "type": "random",
    "probability": 0.015,
    "conditions": []
  },
  "variables": {
    "speaker": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "说话人"
    },
    "listener": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "听话人"
    },
    "content": {
      "type": "text",
      "maxLength": 200,
      "description": "悄悄话内容，应该温柔或暧昧"
    },
    "time": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "时间，如深夜2:00"
    },
    "mood": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "氛围",
      "options": [
        "温柔",
        "紧张",
        "暧昧",
        "悲伤",
        "甜蜜"
      ],
      "default": "温柔"
    }
  },
  "promptTemplate": "请生成一张「note」的内容。\n\n背景信息：\n- 当前场景：{{scene}}\n- 发送者：{{sender}}\n- 接收者：{{recipient}}\n\n要求：\n1. 内容要符合该卡片的风格和情境\n2. 语气要自然、有代入感\n3. 字数控制在100-300字之间\n\n请直接输出内容，不要有其他说明。",
  "style": {
    "theme": "handwritten",
    "colors": [
      "#2c1810",
      "#6b2020",
      "#3a2020"
    ],
    "mood": "一段深夜的悄悄话记录"
  },
  "rarity": "rare",
  "collectible": true
}